    "summary": "Coverage and quality get chunk calls in a divided review (src/workflow/review-pipeline/adapters/code-review-chunk.ts, a chunk builder with kinds notes / coverage / quality; each dimension's spec gives its kind and framing). Coverage: today's finding item with symbolId required plus notes per promised test; validate rejects non-symbol-coverage findings and symbols the chunk does not hold, so promised-test findings come only from gather. Quality: today's findings plus exactly one description per carried symbol; validate names missing, repeated and foreign ids. Re-issues keep the chunk call with the reasons appended; under the limit today's prompts and schemas are unchanged.",
